<title>USA: Ciprico Inc Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Ciprico Inc Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net sales				 $8,596,000	$6,087,000</p>
<p> Cost of sales			    4,455,000	 3,304,000</p>
<p> Gross profit			     4,141,000	 2,783,000</p>
<p> Sales and marketing		    1,593,000	 1,155,000</p>
<p> General and administrative	     629,000	   538,000</p>
<p> Research and development		 726,000	   513,000</p>
<p> Earnings from operations	     1,193,000	   577,000</p>
<p> Other income, net			  594,000	   134,000</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes	 1,787,000	   711,000</p>
<p> Income tax expense			 649,000	     5,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			     1,138,000	   706,000</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		    .21		 .19</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares     5,416,212	 3,721,065</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
